      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA JUMP (1) jumped well and stalked the lead before boxing on to finish third (17.03) at Murray Bridge Straight in Grade 5. Has failed to finish in the placings from two starts here. Well-placed to take this out. VELARIS (5) settled off the pace but copped a check in the run and missed the frame when fifth in a Grade 4 at this track (20.16). Expected to feature on best form. BLUE ENERGY (4) latest effort finished 2nd over 342m at this track beaten 2.5 lengths (19.85) behind Sailaway Buddy in a Other on September 8. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money.  Something for the Multiples: ADHANA PHILLIP (7)",
